    <briefdescription>
<para>A stub used in txn_commit() during local recovery. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>We &quot;replay&quot; transactions during local recovery, with WAL turned off. Since each transaction attempts to write itself to WAL at commit, we need an implementation which would fake WAL write. </para>    </detaileddescription>
